OL,3,ARoyal Navy service member charged with
OL,4,Aspying
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Navy service member has been
OL,7,Fcharged with spying for an unnamed
OL,8,Fforeign country, police have said.
OL,10,FTeddy Young, 24, from Bedfordshire, has
OL,11,Fbeen charged with offences under the
OL,12,FNational Security Act (NSA) including
OL,13,Fan allegation of obtaining protected
OL,14,Finformation which could benefit an
OL,15,Funnamed foreign power.
OL,17,FHe has been remanded into custody and
OL,18,Fis due to appear at Westminster
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
