OL,3,ATexas carries out first US execution
OL,4,Asince Christa Pike's botched lethal
OL,5,Ainjections
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut courts denied their requests, and
OL,8,Fhe received a fatal dose of
OL,9,Fpentobarbital at the state prison in
OL,10,FHuntsville. He was pronounced dead at
OL,11,F20:03 local time.
OL,13,FHoward was convicted and sentenced to
OL,14,Fdeath for the 2000 murder of a
OL,15,Fconvenience store clerk during a
OL,16,Frobbery he committed.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
